{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something's happened to time. We don't know what, but you've got a gun, the skills to use it, and plenty of enemies to shoot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weapon Customization</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your guns, to play the way you want. Turn your assault rifle into a bullet spraying machine, or a long range deadly rifle. Make your sniper more powerful and explosive, or change to full auto and spray bullets everywhere. Silence your weapons, use homing rounds, bouncing bullets, and much more. Balance your weapons into their ultimate form, and blast the robots into scrap metal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513100/extras/c0f023b12a3441a3fa5756dbebb075be.avif?t=1772713679\" width=1560 height=531 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become more powerful by combining your favorite abilities, guns and throw-able consumables (like auto turrets, shields, or grenades, etc.) to decimate your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513100/extras/bb2af5d40bc40045e21cdb0d47309c7b.poster.avif?t=1772713679\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513100/extras/bb2af5d40bc40045e21cdb0d47309c7b.webm?t=1772713679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513100/extras/bb2af5d40bc40045e21cdb0d47309c7b.mp4?t=1772713679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swords</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or take out your enemies the old fashioned way. Wield a sword, axe, hammer, and more, to smash them to pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513100/extras/e16a3505c99e0e18f480fa7501a2f0ee.poster.avif?t=1772713679\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513100/extras/e16a3505c99e0e18f480fa7501a2f0ee.webm?t=1772713679\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3513100/extras/e16a3505c99e0e18f480fa7501a2f0ee.mp4?t=1772713679\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Time?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513100/ca5e9524b9472cde8a09661156ea46fcce9dfcf4.jpg"},{"name":"Training Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513100/be8391cd30d38b3de68936476d8a80c856319513.jpg"},{"name":"Beat Him at His Own Game","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513100/be3b3f64d0cd3b31d912f9bf4870836e31a86a02.jpg"},{"name":"Chicken","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513100/663586538677af89580d8607b4ebaae880d98fc7.jpg"},{"name":"Hammer Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513100/06bcbaef6dd8543142749f152b5d32ffa0922b76.jpg"},{"name":"Hammer Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513100/992b177178b8a81b985d12de00e181229e8574bd.jpg"},{"name":"The Destroyer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513100/a268e63da1671c9924f7234d716446901f30c07b.jpg"},{"name":"Spider Swatter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3513100/0b53b7fe457cd7c90703cd6e7c82c284fec413c5.jpg"},{"name":"Vault Ov